{
    "id":  11752,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "COB LED Strip 220V 840 LED/m 50m | FLIP CHIP 1600Lm/M 20W/M | CRI90 | IP67 | Cut 10cm",
    "reference":  "SPGM840D20W-CW-91647",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover the \u003cstrong\u003eCOB 220V LED Strip\u003c/strong\u003e, a continuous, high-performance lighting solution with \u003cstrong\u003eFlip Chip Invisible Rectifier technology\u003c/strong\u003e. Offers \u003cstrong\u003eup to 1600Lm/meter\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eperfect light uniformity\u003c/strong\u003e. Made of \u003cstrong\u003esilicone with IP67 protection\u003c/strong\u003e, ideal for \u003cstrong\u003eindoor and outdoor use\u003c/strong\u003e. \u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC dimmable\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo \u003cstrong\u003eexternal power supply or rectifier cable\u003c/strong\u003e needed. Its \u003cstrong\u003ethermal adhesive\u003c/strong\u003e improves fixation and \u003cstrong\u003ecut every 10 cm\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eCOB 220V LED Strip 840 LED/m 50m | FLIP CHIP 1600Lm/M 20W/M | CRI90 | IP67 | Cut 10cm\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCOB 220V LED Strip. 840 LED/m FLIP CHIP. 50m roll, 20W/m, 1600Lm/m. CRI90, IP67. Cut every 10cm. TRIAC dimmable. No transformer needed.\u003c/p\u003e",
